🎓 Enterprise Learning Management System (Microservices Architecture)
Built with Spring Boot, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Docker, Spring Security, and JWT

Welcome to the Enterprise Learning Management System (ELMS) — a modern, distributed, microservices-based backend designed for large organizations to manage learning content, courses, users, assessments, certifications, and reporting at scale.
This application is engineered using Spring Boot microservices, backed by MySQL and PostgreSQL, and built to operate reliably in enterprise environments.

